  (text "PINLED chained-mux module  -  4-wire chain interface: VCC / GND / DATA / CLK" (at 25.4 259.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid 9e2d2128-d01c-4421-8d46-9f286b4f7cef))
  (text "1. U5A inverts CLK_IN (Schmitt): counter U1 and DONE FF U4 clock on FALLING edges of CLK_IN." (at 25.4 264.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid c68f0182-60e2-42a1-8880-176521c6a206))
  (text "   First rising edge of an incoming burst arms ACT (releases /CLR) a half period before the first count edge." (at 25.4 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid f2a1ca1f-ce75-43e1-81eb-98892538f86c))
  (text "2. U1: ENT=1, ENP=/DONE, load inputs grounded, /LOAD=1. Counts 0..15, wraps 15->0, then parks at 0." (at 25.4 274.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid e8633f68-7d89-4293-bee9-f97737bfab62))
  (text "3. U4A (J-/K FF): J=RCO, /K=1 -> DONE sets on the same edge the counter wraps. RCO feeds ONLY synchronous" (at 25.4 279.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid f5ff7eb5-385e-4827-8cf7-d185bb3a47b1))
  (text "   inputs (J), sampled on the clock edge, so RCO decode spikes can never propagate." (at 25.4 284.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid 75c446fc-b8b2-4fa1-9812-0f459c0fa0c1))
  (text "4. CLK_OUT = CLK_IN AND DONE  (U6 G3 as NAND + U5C invert). Clock forwards to the next module only after" (at 25.4 289.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid 79b643bb-bc1e-40af-85b6-d6e182874b6d))
  (text "   this module finishes; first forwarded pulse is full width (DONE changes while CLK_IN is low)." (at 25.4 294.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid c2803f51-faaa-468e-aff2-d0c3dee8ff2e))
  (text "5. Mux enables: /E_A = /(ACT & /DONE & /QD), /E_B = /(ACT & /DONE & QD)  (U6 G1,G2; /QD from U5D)." (at 25.4 299.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid 5ac2694e-c711-4162-8eb8-9f0867e788d8))
  (text "   Waiting modules (no clock -> ACT low) and finished modules (DONE) tri-state DATA. Exactly one driver." (at 25.4 304.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid 464268ef-3c6e-413c-928f-83ca839bb95a))
  (text "6. ACT detector: D1 pumps C1 on CLK edges, R1 bleeds it. tau = 10 ms: run CLK >= 1 kHz; master idles CLK" (at 25.4 309.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid a85527b8-6e98-4387-9297-040c487d7f6d))
  (text "   low >= 50 ms between frames -> ACT drops -> async-clears U1 and DONE in every module. No /MR wire." (at 25.4 314.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid d91717cf-2954-4c17-81ab-925d752697cb))
  (text "7. Master: drive CLK, sample DATA just before each falling edge. Sample n (1-based) = line (n-1) mod 16" (at 25.4 320.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid ba4f7f5a-fc1d-45ad-93ce-1788c9d86ee0))
  (text "   of module ceil(n/16). Frame = 16*N clocks + idle gap. Put a ~100k pulldown on DATA at the master." (at 25.4 325.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid c37f5310-44e4-4990-833a-f9f3953691cf))
